WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
- So, do you do anything
for Valentine's Day?

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:03.760
Do you go all out or do you just chill?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.600
- No, well, you know
what I used to do a lot,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.090
was I was always waitressing
on Valentine's Day.

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:09.923
- Me too.

00:00:09.923 --> 00:00:12.010
- Yeah, 'cause I was a waitress
for a really long time.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:16.480
But the real fun is actually
the day before Valentine's,

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.430
which is--

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:18.630
- [Kelly] I know where
you're going with this.

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:19.502
- Yes.

00:00:19.502 --> 00:00:20.570
- That's when you.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.100
- That's the day you
have the most cash sales,

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.450
because that's--

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.950
- Because people don't want
you to follow that trail,

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.872
'cause they're not with their person.

00:00:29.872 --> 00:00:30.705
Yes!

00:00:30.705 --> 00:00:31.610
- That's what my restaurant managers

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:32.900
- It's mistress day, yeah.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.870
- That's the day.
- Yeah.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.740
It's a real thing if
you've ever waited tables.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.690
It's so sad, but it's real.

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.341
Like and they pay with cash
and you're like mmm-kay.

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.350
- You're like yep.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.641
Like why are all my sales cash?

00:00:44.641 --> 00:00:45.474
- Yeah.

00:00:45.474 --> 00:00:48.740
I spent a lot of holidays
waiting tables as well.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.779
And people don't get
how hard you work at it.

00:00:50.779 --> 00:00:52.810
They're always like I need this now.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.420
I'm like so do the other seven tables.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.490
Slow your role.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:56.323
- Everybody needs somethin'.

00:00:56.323 --> 00:00:58.020
- Yeah, turns out you aren't special.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.240
I have to wait on everyone.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:02.176
But anyway, I was a
good waitress, I swear.

00:01:02.176 --> 00:01:03.230
(laughing)

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.260
But did you have any other jobs,
like before hitting it big?

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:11.250
- Oh well, I was a personal
trainer for about two weeks.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.930
- I worked at a gym.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.690
But I would have never
been a personal trainer.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:15.945
- I shouldn't have been.

00:01:15.945 --> 00:01:17.580
(laughing)

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.550
- So, you like really, that takes a lot.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:21.200
Like I would never, no.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.630
Did you feel comfortable doing that?

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:23.463
- Nope.

00:01:23.463 --> 00:01:24.350
- You have to know all the things.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:25.430
- No comfort.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:26.870
- [Kelly] No comfort.

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:27.840
- No motivation.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:30.620
It's like people were
coming to me to be motivated

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:33.384
and I didn't have anything for them.

00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:34.217
(laughing)

00:01:34.217 --> 00:01:36.230
- You're like, you know
what, do 10 times, or eight,

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:37.063
I don't care.

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:38.051
Like yeah.

00:01:38.051 --> 00:01:39.330
Do 10 reps or none.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.913
I don't care what you do.

